# Signatures and company stamp (2026-10-07). Kept on this PC and in its profile
# backups only - never in git, where anyone with access to the repository could
# take the original images. Older commits still contain them until the history
# is rewritten.
data/profiles/*/assets/sigs/
static/sigs/
# SQLite WAL side files (multi-user, 2026-10-22). Checkpoint before committing data:
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Office server (2026-10-23): accounts, sessions, logs, uploads, per-person temp - never in git
data/server/
data/users/
data/logs/

